  "enunciado": "A campus wayfinding map marks twelve sectors. Color each region with red, green or blue. A region pair separated by a dash denotes a direct link. Linked regions must have different colors. The links work both ways. The regions are Arena, Bridge, Cafe, Clinic, Dorm, Gym, Hall, Lab, Library, Oaks, Pond, Quad.\n1. Library is green.\n2. Bridge is blue.\n3. Library–Oaks, Library–Pond.\n4. Bridge–Cafe, Bridge–Lab, Bridge–Library, Bridge–Oaks, Bridge–Quad.\n5. Arena–Bridge, Arena–Gym, Arena–Lab, Arena–Library.\n6. Lab–Quad.\n7. Gym–Lab, Gym–Pond, Gym–Quad.\n8. Dorm–Lab, Dorm–Oaks, Dorm–Pond.\n9. Clinic–Dorm, Clinic–Quad.\n10. Hall–Lab, Hall–Oaks, Hall–Pond.\n11. Cafe–Dorm, Cafe–Pond.\nFor each named region, give its color.",
